# A built catalog is ~860 MB and is NOT a repository artifact.  It is also not
# reproducible: JPL adds bodies daily, so a rebuilt catalog is a different
# length and comparable with nothing already measured.  Keep your own copies,
# and keep the `catalog_date` and `pipeline_version` stamps with them.
